*.xpi
dist
node_modules
__pycache__

# Everything dot-prefixed, at any depth: editor and tool droppings land
# there, and the build/lint tooling writes several multi-megabyte caches
# (.schema-cache, .experiments-cache, .lib-*-cache) that are trivially
# re-downloaded and must never be committed. Opt the few we do track back
# in below - .github has to be un-ignored as a directory, or git will not
# descend into it to find the workflows.
.*
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.npmrc
!.prettierignore
!.github/

# Event-log captures from suite runs - the wire for a failing run is the
# only evidence an intermittent bug leaves, so they are kept, but they are
# large and local.
test/wire/

# Suite run reports - one per run, written as it goes and read with
# `tail -f`. The interesting ones are quoted into an issue or a commit.
test/runs/
